    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "P. Marry & Associates presents to the market a unique opportunity to purchase a spacious and beautifully proportioned four bedroom town house with private rear access to the North Beach in Skerries. This residence boasts an abundance of original period features including high ceilings, picture rails and ornate coving, original window shutters to mention but a few.  Located in the heart of the town with all amenities, essential and social, on your doorstep including the beach and harbour, shops, restaurants, Church, Schools etc., this one off property is guaranteed to attract a host of potential buyers looking for their forever home.\r\n\r\nViewing is an absolute must to fully appreciate this wonderful town house."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Feature Entrance Hall: (8.67m X 1.84m)     Feature high ceilings, telephone point, smoke alarm, dado rail with half panelled wall, picture rails, ornate coving, understairs storage.\r\n\r\nLiving room: (5.22m X 4.05m)    Feature high ceilings, original window shutters, picture rails, feature fireplace, coving.\r\n\r\nDining/Family room: (5.22m X 4.46m)     Feature fireplace, picture rails, original window shutters, T.V. point\r\n\r\nKitchen: (3.42m X 4.51m)   Wall & floor mounted units, part tiled walls, wood panelled ceiling, range cooker, plumbed for washing machine, original window shutters, access to lean to and rear garden\r\n\r\nLanding (level one)   Built-in storage, access to attic, smoke alarm\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom: (2.17m X 1.69m)  W.C., W.H.B., Shower unit with electric shower, wood panelled ceiling, tiled floor, tiled walls, shaving light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:  (3.42m X 3.32m)  Harbour and sea views\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: (5.22m X 3.09m)   Feature high ceilings, feature fireplace, telephone point, harbour and sea views.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: (5.42m X 3.51m)   Feature High ceilings, feature fireplace, picture rail.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: (4.19m X 2.94m)   Feature high ceilings\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE:\r\nFRONT: On street  parking\r\nREAR: Old stone feature boundary walls,  Garden chalet, mature planted areas, private access to north beach."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "SPECIAL FEATURES\r\nTown centre location\r\nBeautiful harbour and sea views\r\nNot overlooked front or rear\r\nOil fired central heating\r\nOriginal feature high ceilings\r\nAntique window shutters\r\nAlarm system\r\nDouble glazed\r\nPicture rails\r\nOrnate coving"
      }
